# ---- 原始素材 ----
# 仓库只保留每个状态的第一张原图作为示例，其余素材由使用者本地维护。
# 需要增加示例图时，在下方补一行 ! 例外即可。
source/origin_images/*.png
source/origin_images/*.jpg
source/origin_images/*.jpeg
!source/origin_images/idle_1.png
!source/origin_images/touch_1.png
!source/origin_images/scratch_1.png
!source/origin_images/play_1.png
!source/origin_images/sleep_1.png
!source/origin_images/dragging_1.png
!source/origin_images/menu_1.png
!source/origin_images/startled_1.png
!source/origin_images/landed_1.png
!source/origin_images/logo_1.png
!source/origin_images/menubar_1.png

